Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:27.23,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look inside me without \Npermission. I hate it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:28.23,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.90,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Then come down from there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.61,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,and I'll look down on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:51.02,Show_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(1191,431)\t(1192,1316,1 \c&H0700D7&\3c&H6659E4&)\t(1317,1941,1 \c&H172918&\3c&H8CCECB&)\t(6197,6529,1 \c&H0F0063&\3c&H222781&)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:12.73,Ep_Title_Shadow,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,1)\fs20\pos(612,310)}Episode 6:  {\fs24}After Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:12.73,Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(529,1)\fs20\pos(612,310)}Episode 6:  {\fs24}After Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:17.92,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You're being awfully hostile, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:19.60,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn straight I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:21.89,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You just killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:25.30,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This is the thanks I get for fixing your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:27.93,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, and you ripped out \Nmy heart right after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.15,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:36.09,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure I can accept being \Nstuck with you even after death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.98,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,This works out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.27,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.13,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Hope you're ready for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:03:00.25,Italics,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,He was aiming for where I stood?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.59,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:02.87,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:04.81,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:07.59,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Man, you're boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:14.13,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I landed that one perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.33,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.33,0:03:18.00,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.74,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It's my Innate Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:22.63,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Innate Domain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:24.77,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,That thing Fushiguro was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.33,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,You could also say we're in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:30.19,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, we're not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.13,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,If you'll accept my conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:35.73,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fix your heart and bring us back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.47,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Cocky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:41.07,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You act all big, but I know \Nyou don't want to die, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.46,0:03:43.60,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,The situation's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.60,0:03:44.80,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,In the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.57,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be able to see something interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.42,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I have two conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:56.66,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,One: when I chant "Extension," you'll \Nhand over your body for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.86,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Two: you'll forget this promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:00.96,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:04.05,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what your goal is, \Nbut it's shady as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:06.33,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,After what you did this time, I finally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.85,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,You're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:10.17,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not lending you my body again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:15.81,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll promise that I won't kill or \Ninjure anyone during that minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:17.85,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,So annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:19.63,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Like I can believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.83,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,It's not about whether you believe me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.40,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,This is a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.22,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,A geas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.79,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be the one punished if I break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:34.93,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,If you pursue selfish gain beyond \Nyour means, you'll earn retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.87,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I'm pretty sure you've \Nexperienced that for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.04,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't a problem before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:43.29,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.06,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,That time I wanted to switch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:49.43,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,And you were just doing \Nas that sorcerer told you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:54.62,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,A pact founded in mutual interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:57.67,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,That's one of the key factors \Nbehind all jujutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.30,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, then. So move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.75,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'll accept your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:12.46,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what you're trying to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:15.41,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,but it means I'll come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:22.27,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Like hell I'd say that. Bring me back \Nto life without any conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:25.26,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,It's your fault I died in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.05,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:31.79,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,We'll fight to the death, and if you win, \NI'll do it without conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:35.00,Main,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,If I win, you come back \Nto life under my conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.04,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! I'll beat you to—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.48,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:47.70,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I have a bad personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:48.51,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.51,0:05:50.46,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Ijichi, expect a hard forehead flick later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.32,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,F-Forehead flick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:55.22,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Being a teacher isn't my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:58.49,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know why I decided \Nto teach at this school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:05:59.85,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:02.23,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:04.69,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Because I have a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:06.63,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.63,0:06:07.57,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:12.88,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,As you can see in this case with Yuuji, \Nthe top of the jujutsu world is a den of vice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:16.48,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Conservative fools. Traditional \Nfools. Arrogant fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:17.59,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Just plain fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:20.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bargain sale on rotten mikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:24.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I want to reset that garbage jujutsu world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:29.80,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Murdering everyone at the \Ntop would be an easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:34.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,But they would just get replaced.\NIt wouldn't bring a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:37.69,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,And if I did that, no one would follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:41.54,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I chose education.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:45.48,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,To raise up strong, clever comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:50.99,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That's also why I occasionally \Ntossed my missions to my students.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:51.95,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:53.75,Italics,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure you don't \Njust want to slack off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:55.64,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,They're all talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:59.50,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Especially the third-year, Hakari, \Nand the second-year, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.80,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,They'll become jujutsu \Nsorcerers on a par with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:05.18,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuji {\i1}was{\i0} one of those, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:09.94,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:12.96,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm about to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.62,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you just gonna watch from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:19.91,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, I'm completely naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:21.95,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,G-G-G-Gojou-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.94,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,H-H-H-H-H-H-He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:24.56,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Ijichi, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.46,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm kind of disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:29.44,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I'm embarrassed to ask, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:30.35,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:31.93,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(188,1)\fs10\shad0\c&H2F312C&\3c&HDDDFDA&\bord1\pos(85,24)}In the meantime, \Nput this on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:33.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.98,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Good to be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:46.10,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh, I'll have to revise the reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:47.75,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,No, leave them as-is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:53.92,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I want to give Yuuji time to gain the minimum \Npower necessary before he's targeted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:58.17,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Shouko, but could you leave \NYuuji listed as dead on the records?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:02.10,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,So you plan to keep Itadori \Ncompletely hidden away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:05.42,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll have him make his comeback \Nin time for the Exchange Event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.16,Main,Shouko,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.60,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,The reason is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:12.77,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,No one's allowed to take the events \Nof youth away from young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:15.10,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I bet everyone will be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.01,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Not anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:27.06,Italics,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,Starting right now, I'm ditching work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.51,0:08:30.16,Italics,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,I've always had a strong \Nsense of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.03,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:34.16,Italics,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,I've been saving up my earnings so I can \Nsend my four younger sisters to college, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:32.44,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Aniki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:34.16,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Niini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.51,Main,Sister,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Onii-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.95,Italics,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,But even I can't fight my survival instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:39.22,Italics,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,If I go near that table, I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:41.20,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Gojou Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:44.68,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if we could kill him \Nif we joined forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.97,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Either he'd flutter out of your grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.56,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,or worst case, you'd all get exorcised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:54.67,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,I would recommend you pour energy \Ninto sealing him rather than killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:56.16,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Seal him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.39,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:09:01.49,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,We'll use the special-grade \Ncursed object, Prison Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:04.16,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Prison Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:06.92,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Table 5 hasn't ordered anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.58,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Someone go hurry him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.32,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,He's taking up a whole table by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.30,Main,Worker,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, boss, but I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.49,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.97,0:09:16.65,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.97,0:09:19.76,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,You have that detestable thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.99,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Our AC is running, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:26.80,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,Jougo, don't get too excited. \NYou'll make it hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:31.50,Main,Owner,0000,0000,0000,,Sir, have you decided on your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:40.81,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,I wish you wouldn't cause \Ntoo much commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.76,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,This is hardly anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:46.53,Main,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.68,0:09:57.88,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad we didn't choose \Nan expensive restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.28,0:10:11.11,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,Getou, how strong am I \Nin terms of Sukuna's fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:14.55,Main,Getou,0000,0000,0000,,At a low estimate, \NI'd say eight or nine fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:18.56,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,That's plenty. Give me the Prison Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.97,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,I'll add it to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.56,0:10:23.59,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,In return, I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.46,Main,Jougo,0000,0000,0000,,kill Gojou Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:27.22,Main,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Help—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.03,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:44.04,Eyecatch_Title,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\fad(864,1)}Jujutsu Kaisen
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.03,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,By the time we arrived on the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:50.58,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,your son was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:56.55,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, I was skeptical about \Nsaving any of the people in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:59.54,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,But my friend was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.60,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,He wasn't successful,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:07.10,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but he tried to bring your son's body back \Nfor you after we confirmed his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:10.31,Flashback,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:15.52,Main,Tag,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(272,263)\pos(444,280)\b1\c&H534939&\bord0\shad0\fay.05\frx6\fry8}Okazaki Tadashi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.09,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Take this, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:27.87,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\c&H534939&\bord0\shad0\fay.05\fs18\frz353.5\pos(298.666,212)\frx8\fry356}Okazaki Tadashi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:30.32,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry we weren't \Nable to save Tadashi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:35.34,Main,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right. Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:40.92,Main,Mother,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the only one who will \Nmourn his passing, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.82,0:11:51.73,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,You're late, Megumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:52.93,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Kelp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.93,0:11:54.17,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.53,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.48,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Zenin-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:02.96,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What kinds of people do you want \Nto save as a jujutsu sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:03.63,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:07.63,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I care if my actions save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.63,0:12:09.09,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:09.82,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:11.42,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:14.92,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Quit asking interview prep questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:15.90,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Switch with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.44,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sick of these school uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:20.00,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go buy some cute tracksuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.77,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.03,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,What are those two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:27.36,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Falling practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:28.24,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Mustard leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.32,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,You're both weak in \Nclose quarters, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:31.67,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,So first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.02,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Land a blow on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.60,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,We'll talk after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:43.42,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You're a head above the rest when \Nit comes to close combat, Yuuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.05,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,So what you need to learn right now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.03,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,is how to control cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:50.29,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,as well as the bare minimum\Nof jujutsu knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.79,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HBB65E0&\3c&HE7DAEA&\shad0\b1\fs14\pos(364.667,184.667)}Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.79,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HBB65E0&\3c&HE7DAEA&\shad0\b1\fs14\pos(518,194.667)}Smile
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:52.47,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:58.25,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HBB65E0&\3c&HE7DAEA&\shad0\b1\bord0\fs20\an5\pos(70,63)}ee-hee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.79,0:12:58.25,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HBB65E0&\3c&HE7DAEA&\shad0\b1\bord0\fs20\an5\pos(536,131)}ee-hee
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:58.26,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I figured you'd be the best person \Nto train me, so I'm just happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.30,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm weak, and I couldn't save anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.11,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Worse, I nearly killed Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:09.60,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,As I am now, I won't be able to face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:12.36,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I want to become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.72,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Teach me to be the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:22.19,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a keen eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:25.88,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, you're the one who \Ncalled yourself the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:30.12,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,All right, first, take a look at \Nthose drink cans over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:37.12,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,This is with cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.13,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,and this is with a cursed technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.27,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I see. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.12,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.39,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Think of cursed energy as electricity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:47.58,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,and cursed techniques as appliances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:51.11,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Electricity by itself is hard to use, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:56.00,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That's why we run electricity through \Nappliances to achieve various results.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:59.71,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I just fired off pure cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:03.14,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I channeled cursed energy\Ninto a cursed technique
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.14,0:14:05.50,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,to activate it and twist the can with jujutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:10.08,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I'm about to learn \Na very, very good cursed technique?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.50,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,No, you can't use cursed techniques.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:13.73,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:17.86,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Setting aside simple shikigami and barriers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:22.26,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,cursed techniques are fundamentally etched \Ninto your body from the day you're born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:28.18,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,So the power of a jujutsu sorcerer \Nis roughly 80% innate talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:31.40,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:36.63,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought I'd be able to pull off thunder \Nor fire or a power bomb or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:38.98,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You can pull off a power bomb. Ohnita's, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.45,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:48.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to pull off a Spirit Gun or \NBankai, or Rasengan, or a Dodon Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:48.54,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You just can't use them {\i0}yet{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:52.95,Italics,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Eventually Sukuna's cursed techniques \Nwill be engraved into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:54.77,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I wanted to fire off a Kamehameha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.59,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just ignore what you can't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.33,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to enhance your strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.65,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}This totally sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.91,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,We'll get you to imbue your \Nfighting style with cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.07,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm way more scared of someone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:04.24,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,who can force their way through with \Nthe basics than I am of inferior jujutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:07.76,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Like I just said, your talent \Nfor close combat is top-notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.92,Main,Yuji,0000,0000,0000,,But wait! I can already do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:15.71,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Back then, I somehow managed \Nto get the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.21,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Then give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.83,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Hit me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.32,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Not that you actually can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:26.56,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Don't blame me if you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.56,0:15:28.08,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Just hurry up and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.75,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That didn't have any \Ncursed energy behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:35.99,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:38.67,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Negative emotions are \Nthe source of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:43.04,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,In the incident you're referring to, you were \Nprobably brimming with anger and fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.02,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,So you have to constantly be \Nflipping out to use cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.69,0:15:51.77,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it, \NFushiguro's always a bit snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:53.10,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Demon Dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:55.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.24,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.00,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I just got really irritated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:00.60,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:02.02,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:02.65,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Salmon roe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:05.61,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,There's only a month and a half until \Nthe Exchange Event, so no dawdling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:08.10,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Here, you can try the long one next.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:12.55,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,This actually feels pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:18.54,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's trained to produce cursed \Nenergy using the faintest sparks of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:24.67,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,They've also trained on how to not waste \Ncursed energy when emotions are flaring, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.75,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,There are several methods to train this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:31.31,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be having you use \Na pretty exhausting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.30,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.61,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Watching movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.10,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Watching movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:38.62,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:42.35,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Everything from masterpieces to C-grade \Nhorror films and terrible French movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:44.57,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be watching them nonstop \Nas long as you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:46.81,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, you won't just be watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.28,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be watching them with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.65,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the cute but creepy doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:55.40,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:57.65,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's a cursed corpse the principal made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:17:00.17,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I knew it! It has his sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:08.32,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,And? I don't understand \Nwhat you're getting at here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.82,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be hasty, now. You'll see soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:16.28,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That cursed corpse will wake up \Nand attack you, just like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:18.85,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,if you don't keep pouring a set \Namount of cursed energy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:21.31,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:25.45,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Like I just said, we have all \Nkinds of movies available here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:28.08,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Heart-throbbers, thrillers, exciting ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:30.57,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,ones that'll make you cry, \Nlaugh, or feel disgusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.94,0:17:32.32,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs12\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&H949A94&\c&HD5D6D2&\frz296.8\pos(515,78)\blur1}Yawn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:33.66,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Your first goal is to watch an entire movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:36.08,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,from start to finish, \Nwithout waking the cursed corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.07,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs12\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&H949A94&\c&HD5D6D2&\blur1\pos(532,99)\frz300}Num   {\frz-76}Num
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,This trains you to maintain a steady
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:41.33,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,output of cursed energy, \Nno matter what emotions you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.56,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You can't use too much or too little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:52.96,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I have it set to the faint level of cursed \Nenergy you can produce right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.96,0:17:55.50,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,but it'll steadily start \Ndemanding greater output,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:57.44,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,so don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:00.41,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't let it down even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.69,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.69,0:18:03.21,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I recommend this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:06.18,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,The heroine's annoying, \Nbut she dies spectacularly in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:07.85,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Major spoilers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.84,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,I say we start off with an action—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.42,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:16.79,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, even if you're irritated, \Nkeep the cursed energy steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.73,0:18:20.07,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Carrying cursed tools, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:23.88,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I agree with supplementing \Nmy close combat with weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:27.61,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,but with my cursed technique, I want to \Nbe able to free up both hands at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.61,0:18:30.34,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,With swords, you lose time sheathing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:35.02,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Zenin-senpai, you often carry more \Nthan two around with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:36.24,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.00,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,I make Panda carry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:40.30,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have asked, part two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:44.62,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,Some sorcerers keep cursed spirits \Nthat can store and retrieve objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:47.72,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,He can't do that. It's a rare thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.95,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,And it takes time to tame them, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.99,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,But if you find any, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:53.69,Main,Panda,0000,0000,0000,,A year's supply of Calpas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:54.76,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.40,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.92,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,did you run back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:04.00,Flashback,Sukuna,0000,0000,0000,,What a waste of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.79,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I have the potential to beat special-grades?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.78,Italics,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what he meant by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.53,Main,Toge,0000,0000,0000,,Tuna, tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:19.13,Main,Maki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.27,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.48,Main,Fushiguro,0000,0000,0000,,I think I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:31.90,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Ura-Hara! Where's Ura-Hara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:32.61,Main,Kugisaki,0000,0000,0000,,Underground?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:38.30,Italics,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Do I cut the red wire or the blue wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:43.88,Italics,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,You know, in the area where I used to live, \Nthe designated trash bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.10,0:19:46.92,Italics,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you going on about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.86,Italics,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,...were red for plastic trash \Nand blue for combustible trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:52.37,Italics,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I always thought, shouldn't it be the opposite?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.38,Italics,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,It should be red! Anyone would go with red!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.39,Italics,Man,0000,0000,0000,,I'll trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:17.03,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do that while I'm drinking soda!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:18.28,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:21.03,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But you gotta have chips and soda \Nwhen watching movies at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:22.40,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.09,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I have some business to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:27.80,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep hanging in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:30.19,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Will this really make me stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:34.34,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:37.60,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Did you talk to Sukuna while you were dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:39.04,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:44.92,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,When he fixed your heart, did he \Npropose any conditions or contracts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:48.52,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I think we did talk about something...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.36,0:20:51.53,Main,Yuuji,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't remember what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.72,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:01.85,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,We have a bit of time before your \Nappointment with the principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:03.38,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you want to stop anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.52,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.70,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show up early for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:11.84,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.26,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:15.41,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.41,0:21:18.40,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? A-Are you testing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.96,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're not going to hit me if \NI actually go on ahead, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:22.94,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Just what do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.39,Main,Ijichi,0000,0000,0000,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:33.55,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:44.00,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:17.61,sign_32727_342_Juju_Stroll,Screen&Voice,0000,0000,0000,,Juju Stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:22.14,sign_33547_393_Gojou_Satoru_s_G,Child,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(404,1)\4a&HAA&}Gojou Satoru's {\c&H1411D7&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(1490,1948,1 \1a&H00&\4a&HAA&}Go Go {\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(2074,2281,1 \1a&H00&\4a&HAA&}Gojou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:22.14,Main,Child,0000,0000,0000,,It's Gojou Satoru's Go Go Gojou!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.32,0:23:23.82,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Today we're at my alma mater,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:26.74,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Tokyo Metropolitan Jujutsu \NTechnical High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:26.71,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(482,180)\pos(320,284)\c&H4326E5&\b1\bord0\shad0}Satoru-sensei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.74,0:23:29.30,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh? We already have a boy in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:31.76,Main,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(482,180)\c&H725AFE&\b1\bord0\shad0\pos(284,284)}Yuuji
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:30.67,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Is he a new student?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:32.74,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It looks like he can't produce \Ncursed energy very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:33.89,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Let's give him some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.28,0:23:37.07,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Imagine you're walking down a narrow path.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.98,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,Before you is a row of college boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.76,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,They haven't noticed you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:45.06,Main,Gojou,0000,0000,0000,,You want to kill them, don't you? So you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.60,0:23:45.06,Main,Itadori,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.65,0:23:55.07,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(947,1)}Episode 7: \NAssault